# The mihomo shipped in tabby's release archives (scripts/dist.sh).
# To ship another release, change all three lines: the sums are the `digest`
# of the assets `mihomo-linux-amd64-v1-<tag>.gz` and `mihomo-linux-arm64-<tag>.gz`
# (`gh api repos/MetaCubeX/mihomo/releases/tags/<tag>`).
